{{Quote|Grants the user a body of blades, offering immunity to sword attacks and sharp striking abilities.|Shop}}
'''Blade''' is a {{Common}} [[Natural]]-type of [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|30,000}} or {{Robux|100}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Blade grants the user razor-sharp blades that can be attached to their limbs, allowing them to parry incoming [[Sword|sword]]-based attacks with their arm blades, even if the enemy has [[Aura]] activated. It also lets the user slash opponents with various attacks, ranging from spinning blade strikes to achieving flight by rotating a single blade.

