==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Blade's passive ability grants immunity to all sword attacks, including Aura attacks, as long as the user is ~104% of the enemy's level, similar to [[Elemental]] effects. 
* Low mastery requirements.
* Very cheap and easy to obtain.
* Powerful for PvP.
* Good combo potential — most moves combo into each other easily.
* Good stuns.
* Most attacks can [[Instinct/Break|break Instinct]].
* Good for [[Sea Events]] and [[Raids]].

|{{Ability|TAP}}
* Easy to aim.
* When used in the air, the user can float briefly.
* Great for hitting enemies due to its range.
* Can hit [[Sea Beasts]].
* Has multi-target damage.

|{{Ability|Z}}
* Good range.
* Can be used for movement.
* Great mobility.
* Low cooldown.

|{{Ability|X}}
* Good AoE.
* High stun.

|{{Ability|C}}
* Decent range.
* Good for movements and offers mobility (if hitten an enemy)
* Great damage.
* Good for starting or extending combos.

|{{Ability|F}}
* Direction can be changed mid-flight.
* Useful for transportation in the [[First Sea]] and faster than running.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Most abilities deal poor damage, with most of the damage occurring only on the final tick.
* Ice Trident and Light Spear can still damage Blade users.
* Limited range.
* Only four damaging moves instead of the usual five.
* [[Rengoku]] and [[Saishi]] users can still stun Blade users.

|{{Ability|TAP}}
* Small range.
* Very low damage.
* Cannot aim up or down.
** Attacking downward causes the user to float, preventing hits.
** Attacking upward is nearly impossible due to M1 limitations.

|{{Ability|Z}}
* Requires precise aim.
* Slight start-up time.

|{{Ability|X}}
* Predictable.
* Slight start-up.
* Difficult to hit airborne enemies.

|{{Ability|C}}
* Hard to hit.
* Requires to hit an enemy in order to move.

|{{Ability|F}}
* Very slow.
}}
</tabber>

==Trivia==
* Blade replaced Chop in [[Updates/24|Update 24]], which separated limbs to dodge sword attacks rather than parrying them.
* Although Blade's passive ability avoids sword slash damage, it can also automatically parry swords with fire, freeze, electric, or magic effects.
** However, some swords can still stun Blade users, specifically [[Saishi]], [[Shark Anchor]] and [[Rengoku]].
* Moving forward & rapidly using the TAP move while in the air causes the user to slowly glide at around run speed in the air.
* The abilities of Blade are used by [[Chef]].
* Blade's fruit icon has its stem directly in the middle, whereas on its fruit model, the stem is placed on the far left.
* Blade is one of the only [[Blox Fruits|Common Fruits]] to have an M1 attack, with the other one being [[Bomb]].
* [C] can be used to pull [[Blox Fruits]] towards the user.
* Blade is a good fruit for new players, as it is cheap, repels sword attacks (except if the enemy has [[Aura]] or is a [[Bosses|Boss]]), and can spam M1 if the [[Enemies|Enemy]] is cornered.
* We can say that Blade's [C] can be used to teleport, although it might cause a soft lock, like in the video here where at 0:47, the player is seen stuck in the [[Marine Fortress|Marine Fortress's]] Castle floor. The video can be found here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cpUewHvVwWw

